<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Finance Commission</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Finance Commission was one of the three councils at the centre of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/song-dynasty">Song Dynasty</a> government, alongside the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/secretariat-chancellery">Secretariat-Chancellery</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bureau-of-military-affairs">Bureau of Military Affairs</a>. It managed state finances, and the overlapping jurisdiction of these councils was intended to prevent any single official from gaining excessive power.</p></div>
